@ddd.entity

Purpose:
  Identity-based domain object.

UseWhen:
  - object has distinct identity
  - lifecycle matters
  - equality is based on identity, not attributes

AvoidWhen:
  - simple value with no identity
  - immutable data holder

Why:
  Entities represent things that change over time and need to be tracked.

Related:
  @ddd.value-object
  @ddd.aggregate

Examples:
  @project.payment
  @project.order

State: +
